# RETIRED — DO NOT USE

This agent designed screens in Pencil `.pen` files. **Pencil was retired as the design
source of truth**; the binding contract is now `frontend/DESIGN.md` (direction "Clean
Ink") with tokens in `frontend/constants/design.ts`.

Design work goes through the **`impeccable` skill** instead. See:

- `CLAUDE.md` → Established Development Workflows → 1. Design-to-Code Workflow
- `docs/FRONTEND_WORKFLOW.md`
- `.claude/agents/frontend-developer.md`

The original definition is preserved in git history (removed at the Membership Plans
epic planning, 2026-08-11) should the Pencil flow ever need reconstructing.
